# Everything is out, and the five paths the image needs are named back in. An
# allowlist rather than a list of exclusions: the context otherwise carries
# data/ (hundreds of megabytes of sample uploads), node_modules/ (installed
# again inside the image anyway) and .env — and a path forgotten in a
# denylist ships, while a path forgotten here fails the build loudly.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src
!migrations
